<app-header title="成长关注" sub="" mode="back" variant="hero" />
<view class="page page-with-nav page--hero">
  <view class="segment">
    <view class="segment__item {{tab === 'list' ? 'active' : ''}}" data-tab="list" bindtap="switchTab">我的反馈</view>
    <view class="segment__item {{tab === 'create' ? 'active' : ''}}" data-tab="create" bindtap="switchTab">反馈新情况</view>
  </view>

  <!-- 列表 -->
  <block wx:if="{{tab === 'list'}}">
    <view class="loading-wrap" wx:if="{{loading}}">加载中…</view>

    <view class="card" wx:if="{{!loading && !items.length}}">
      <view class="empty">
        <view class="empty__icon">💬</view>
        <view class="empty__text">还没有反馈过孩子的情况</view>
        <view class="empty__hint">切换到「反馈新情况」，把你观察到的困扰告诉老师</view>
      </view>
    </view>

    <view class="card" wx:for="{{items}}" wx:key="id">
      <view class="between mb-16">
        <text class="badge" style="background:{{item.statusBg}};color:{{item.statusColor}}">{{item.statusText}}</text>
        <text class="text-sm text-muted">{{item.timeText}}</text>
      </view>
      <view class="task-title">{{item.title}}</view>
      <view class="mt-12" wx:if="{{item.category}}">
        <text class="tag">{{item.category}}</text>
      </view>
      <view class="quote">{{item.behavior}}</view>
      <view class="quote quote-teal" wx:if="{{item.taskTitle}}">
        <text class="bold">老师生成的定制任务：</text>{{item.taskTitle}}
      </view>
      <view class="quote" wx:if="{{item.teacherComment}}">
        <text class="bold">老师回复：</text>{{item.teacherComment}}
      </view>
    </view>
  </block>

  <!-- 提交表单 -->
  <block wx:if="{{tab === 'create'}}">
    <view class="card">
      <view class="field__hint mb-16">
        这里用于把你观察到的孩子不足之处反馈给老师。提交后，AI 会先整理并起草一份任务草案，再由老师确认是否生成定制任务并推送到孩子的任务列表。
      </view>

      <view class="field">
        <view class="field__label">孩子需要支持的具体表现 <text class="text-danger">*</text></view>
        <textarea
          class="field__textarea"
          placeholder="比如：最近写作业时容易急躁，遇到不会的题目会直接放弃，需要提醒三四次才愿意再试一次…"
          placeholder-class="ph"
          maxlength="1200"
          value="{{observedBehavior}}"
          data-key="observedBehavior"
          bindinput="onInput"
        />
        <view class="field__hint">{{observedBehavior.length}} / 1200，至少 4 个字</view>
      </view>

      <view class="field">
        <view class="field__label">通常发生在什么场景（选填）</view>
        <input
          class="field__input"
          placeholder="如：放学回家写作业前"
          placeholder-class="ph"
          value="{{context}}"
          data-key="context"
          bindinput="onInput"
        />
      </view>

      <view class="field">
        <view class="field__label">发生频率（选填）</view>
        <input
          class="field__input"
          placeholder="如：一周三四次"
          placeholder-class="ph"
          value="{{frequency}}"
          data-key="frequency"
          bindinput="onInput"
        />
      </view>

      <view class="field">
        <view class="field__label">希望老师给予什么支持（选填）</view>
        <textarea
          class="field__textarea field__textarea--sm"
          placeholder="如：希望孩子遇到困难时愿意说出来，我们也想学着少一些催促…"
          placeholder-class="ph"
          maxlength="800"
          value="{{parentExpectation}}"
          data-key="parentExpectation"
          bindinput="onInput"
        />
      </view>

      <button class="btn btn-primary btn-block" bindtap="onSubmit" disabled="{{submitting}}">
        {{submitting ? '提交中…' : '提交给老师'}}
      </button>
      <view class="field__hint text-center mt-16">提交后老师会结合 AI 整理结果处理，你可以在「我的反馈」里查看进度</view>
    </view>
  </block>
</view>

<nav-bar role="parent" active="concern" />
